# Wolff sign-off: the relay, the forced 3D and the sign-offs.
card    21GF-DEFAULT other_conventions.wolff_signoff.play=true
dealer  N
# seat hand             | auction                              | expect | why
S 8.QJ9853.742.863      | 1C P 1H P 2N P                       | 3C     | a weak six-card heart suit: relay to sign off
N AK2.K4.AQ62.KJ73      | 1C P 1H P 2N P 3C P                  | 3D     | the forced relay
S 8.QJ9853.742.863      | 1C P 1H P 2N P 3C P 3D P             | 3H     | sign off in hearts
S 8.J85.QJ9742.863      | 1C P 1H P 2N P 3C P 3D P             | P      | diamonds: play 3D

